    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20051205.0160\n\nRAMALLAH, West Bank, Dec 5 , 2005\n\nAbbas condemns Israel blast as act of 'terrorism'\n\n\n\n\nPalestinian leader Mahmud Abbas condemned Monday's suicide bomb attack in the Israeli city of Netanya as an act of \"terrorism\" and vowed to bring the perpetrators to justice.\n\n\"We severely condemn this terrorist operation in Netanya,\" a statement from his office said.\n\n\"President Abbas has ordered all the security services to catch whoever is responsible for this attack and bring them to justice.\"",
